 "scratch": "情境：小华收集邮票。5天分别收集了12, 15, 10, 13, 10枚。总和=12+15+10+13+10=60。平均=60/5=12。数据合理，整数结果。",
 "solver_code": "from fractions import Fraction\ndef solve():\n    data = [12, 15, 10, 13, 10]\n    total = sum(data)\n    count = len(data)\n    avg = total / count\n    return [avg]",
